(slower-hummingbird-sv05-figure-eight-route-6dof)
*title Hummingbird powered figure-eight route with bounded rotor allocation
*mode rigid-body-6dof
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=0
*runtime status vehicle aero-load-mode=direct-wrench aero-wrench-frame=source-z-up rotor-allocation=quad-x rotor-arm-m=0.17 rotor-thrust-coefficient=5.57e-6 rotor-reaction-torque-coefficient=1.36e-7 rotor-speed-min=0 rotor-speed-max=1500 reference-area=1.0 reference-length=0.34 dry-mass-kg=0.5 inertia-x=0.00365 inertia-y=0.00368 inertia-z=0.00703 envelope-max-speed=10
*runtime status target latitude-deg=0.0 longitude-deg=0.0 altitude-m=2.0
*runtime status route mode=figure-eight start-latitude-deg=0.0 start-longitude-deg=0.0 duration-s=60.0 start-altitude-m=2.0 figure-eight-length-m=0.8 figure-eight-width-m=0.4 figure-eight-speed-mps=0.1 figure-eight-bank-deg=0.0 position-capture-gain=0.0
*runtime status guidance propnav-gain=0.0 figure-eight-coordinated-turn=false max-sideslip-deg=20 max-pitch-deg=15 rotorcraft-waypoint-gain-mps2-per-m=1.2 rotorcraft-velocity-damping-per-s=1.8 rotorcraft-altitude-gain-mps2-per-m=1.5 rotorcraft-altitude-damping-per-s=2.0 rotorcraft-attitude-gain-nm-per-rad=0.08 rotorcraft-rate-damping-nm-s-per-rad=0.02 rotorcraft-collective-gain-rad-s-per-mps2=20
*runtime status actuator maximum-moment=1 maximum-body-rate-deg-s=720
*runtime status thermal policy=none
*runtime control rotor-speed vehicle=1 default=468.7244338633868 lower=0 upper=1500
*trajectory 1 hummingbird start on 1
  *initial ecic x=6378139.0 y=0.0 z=0.0 qw=0.5 qx=-0.5 qy=-0.5 qz=0.5 xdt=0.0 ydt=0.0 zdt=0.0 time=0.0 mass=0.5 propellant_mass=0.0
  *segment 1 figure-eight
    *integ dtprnt=0.05 dt=0.001
    *fly propnav=4
    *aero cx=(cx) cy=(cy) cz=(cz) cmx=(cmx) cmy=(cmy) cmz=(cmz)
    *when time>60.0 stop
*end
